This repository is a personal, curated mirror of selected proxy-client
rule lists. The majority of rule data is generated by:

  blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script
  https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script

licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0.

We do not produce the original datasets. This repo:

- keeps a small subset used by the owner
- applies local overlays (see source/overlays/)
- re-publishes Clash YAML / Surge list files for personal subscription

Custom Disney+ login/watch lists under rule/Surge/Disneyplus.list and
rule/Surge/DisneyPlus_dl.list are local files and are not overwritten
by the upstream sync.
